<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - Italy.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - Italy.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for Italy made by the Organisation for Economic Co-oepration and Development and published on Thursday in its half-year economic outlook.</p>
<p>		    1996  1997  1998     1996	 1997	1998</p>
<p>		    year  year  year    H1  H2     H1  H2     H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	  0.7   1.0   1.8   0.3  0.5   1.2  1.3   1.9 2.1</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct   4.5   2.4   2.3   4.6  3.1   2.3  2.0   2.3 2.4</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p> Current account 3.5   4.3   4.7   3.1  3.8   4.2  4.3   4.6 4.8</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p>Unemployment  12.1  12.1  11.9  12.1 12.1  12.1 12.1  12.0 11.9</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
